<title>USA: Alaris Medical names Douglas Jeffries CFO.</title>
<headline>Alaris Medical names Douglas Jeffries CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alaris Medical Inc said Tuesday it Douglas Jeffries has joined the company as vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Jeffries was formerly vice president and CFO at Pyxis Corp.</p>
<p>It could not immediately be learned who Jeffries replaces at Alaris.</p>
</text>
